{%- comment -%}
  Text-based payment trust row. Deliberately avoids embedding third-party
  logo artwork (Razorpay/PhonePe/UPI marks are trademarked) — enable the
  actual gateways in Shopify Admin > Settings > Payments, this is just a
  reassurance strip for the storefront.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="payment-trust">
  <p class="payment-trust__label">{{ 'general.payment.secure_checkout' | t: default: 'Secure checkout' }}</p>
  <ul class="payment-trust__list">
    <li class="payment-trust__item">Razorpay</li>
    <li class="payment-trust__item">PhonePe</li>
    <li class="payment-trust__item">UPI</li>
    <li class="payment-trust__item">{{ 'general.payment.cards' | t: default: 'Cards' }}</li>
  </ul>
</div>
